    {
      "title": "1. Why a lifecycle matters",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Raw data does not automatically answer questions. Each phase in the lifecycle performs a distinct",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Reduces ambiguity - turning vague questions into measurable objectives.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensures fitness of data - catching quality problems before they corrupt findings.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Separates concerns - keeping exploratory work from confirmatory work, and analysis from",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Creates checkpoints - natural gates where the team can confirm alignment with stakeholders",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "before investing further.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Without an explicit lifecycle, projects commonly suffer from scope creep, premature modeling on",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "dirty data, and findings that cannot be reproduced or deployed [Source 1, Source 2].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#1-why-a-lifecycle-matters",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2.1 CRISP-DM (Cross-Industry Standard Process for Data Mining)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Developed in the late 1990s by Daimler-Chrysler, SPSS, and NCR. Still the most widely cited open",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#21-crisp-dm-cross-industry-standard-process-for-data-mining",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "standard for data mining and analytics projects [Source 3].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#21-crisp-dm-cross-industry-standard-process-for-data-mining",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Six phases arranged in a cycle (the outer ring can restart after deployment):",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#21-crisp-dm-cross-industry-standard-process-for-data-mining",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Arrows in the CRISP-DM diagram flow in both directions: unsatisfactory evaluation sends the team",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#21-crisp-dm-cross-industry-standard-process-for-data-mining",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "back to modeling or data preparation; business understanding may be revised when data understanding",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#21-crisp-dm-cross-industry-standard-process-for-data-mining",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "reveals the original question is unmeasurable [Source 3].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#21-crisp-dm-cross-industry-standard-process-for-data-mining",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2.2 EMC / Big Data Analytics Lifecycle",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Popularized by EMC's Data Science and Big Data Analytics book and Wiley's companion edition.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Six phases with a heavier emphasis on analytic sandboxes and operationalization [Source 4]:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Discovery",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Data Preparation (ELT/ETL into sandbox)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Model Planning",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Model Building",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Communicate Results",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Operationalize",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Distinct from CRISP-DM in that it explicitly names the sandbox as a prerequisite for phase 2, and",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "distinguishes \"Model Planning\" (choosing techniques) from \"Model Building\" (executing them).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#22-emc-big-data-analytics-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2.3 OSEMN",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A minimalist five-step mnemonic popular in academic data science courses:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Obtain",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Scrub",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Explore",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Model",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "iNterpret",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Strengths: simple and memorable. Weaknesses: omits business framing (starts at \"Obtain\"), ignores",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "deployment, and treats the process as linear [Source 5].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#23-osemn",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2.4 TDSP (Team Data Science Process)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Published by Microsoft in 2017. Closest to CRISP-DM but adds explicit team roles, deliverable",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#24-tdsp-team-data-science-process",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "templates, and agile sprint cadence. Five stages: Business Understanding → Data Acquisition and",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#24-tdsp-team-data-science-process",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Understanding → Modeling → Deployment → Customer Acceptance [Source 5].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#24-tdsp-team-data-science-process",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. Canonical phase descriptions",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The following synthesizes the phases common across frameworks into a single reference. The",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#3-canonical-phase-descriptions",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "references/ files listed in the Sub-skill routing table cover each phase and framework in detail.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#3-canonical-phase-descriptions",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 1 — Problem Definition / Business Understanding",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: stakeholder intent, existing domain knowledge, prior analyses.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: a written problem statement, success criteria (KPIs or evaluation metrics), and an",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "initial set of hypotheses.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The team works with business owners to translate a vague goal (\"improve customer retention\") into",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "a concrete, measurable objective (\"predict 30-day churn with precision ≥ 0.75 at recall ≥ 0.60\").",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Resources, timeline, and risks are assessed here.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Why it matters: an ill-defined question cannot be answered with data. Changing the question",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "halfway through wastes preparation and modeling effort.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall: treating this phase as a formality. Teams that skip or rush it often discover midway",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "through modeling that the available data cannot actually answer the question they care about",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-1-problem-definition-business-understanding",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 2 — Data Acquisition and Understanding",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: problem statement, knowledge of available data sources.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: a data inventory, quality assessment report, initial summary statistics, and a",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "decision on whether the data is sufficient to proceed.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The team collects initial data, examines its structure and provenance, documents quality issues",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "(nulls, duplicates, encoding errors, date range gaps), and explores distributions and",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "inter-variable relationships.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall: trusting that data labeled \"clean\" actually is clean. Source systems commonly have",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "undocumented conventions (e.g., sentinel values like -9999 for missing) that only domain knowledge",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "or careful profiling reveals [Source 1, Source 2].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-2-data-acquisition-and-understanding",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 3 — Data Preparation",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: raw or semi-structured data, quality assessment.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: an analysis-ready dataset (feature matrix + target variable, or cleaned tabular data",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "for descriptive work).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "This phase typically consumes 60–80% of total project time. It includes:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Cleaning: removing or imputing nulls; correcting format inconsistencies; deduplication.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Transformation: normalization, encoding categorical variables, date parsing, log transforms.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Integration: joining tables across systems, resolving entity mismatches.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Feature engineering: constructing derived columns that encode domain knowledge.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "An analytic sandbox - a compute environment with sufficient CPU, RAM, and storage to hold",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "working copies of the data - is often set up at the start of this phase [Source 4].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall - data leakage: features that encode information from the future (relative to the",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "prediction point) will inflate model performance metrics while producing a model that fails in",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "production. Any transformation that aggregates across the full dataset (e.g., computing a",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "z-score mean on both training and test rows) must be fit on training data only and applied to",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "test data [Source 6].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall - aggressive outlier removal: deleting extreme values simplifies modeling but can",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "remove the most informative signals, especially in anomaly detection or fraud contexts [Source 6].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-3-data-preparation",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 4 — Analysis / Modeling",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: analysis-ready dataset, modeling plan (technique selection, validation strategy).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: trained model(s) or analytical findings with performance metrics.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "For descriptive and exploratory analysis, this phase produces summary statistics,",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "visualizations, and identified patterns. For predictive analysis, it produces one or more",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "fitted models with cross-validated performance estimates.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Model planning (choosing the technique family and validation design) is logically distinct from",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "model building (running training and tuning loops). Conflating them leads to technique choices",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "driven by familiarity rather than problem fit [Source 4].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall - overfitting through hyperparameter tuning: testing many parameter combinations",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "without a held-out test set causes the model to fit noise in the validation set, producing",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "strong validation scores that do not transfer to new data [Source 6].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-4-analysis-modeling",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 5 — Evaluation",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: model or analysis output, success criteria from Phase 1.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: judgment of whether findings meet the original objective; recommendation to proceed",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The team compares model performance against the thresholds established in Phase 1, assesses",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "whether the findings have practical as well as statistical significance, and checks that the",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "model's behavior makes sense to domain experts (a sanity check that catches leakage and",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "labeling errors not surfaced by metrics alone).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "If evaluation fails, the team loops back - usually to Phase 3 (more features, different",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "cleaning) or Phase 2 (additional data sources).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall - confusing statistical and practical significance: a result can be statistically",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "significant yet too small to matter operationally. A 0.1% improvement in click-through rate may",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "not justify the cost of implementation [Source 6].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-5-evaluation",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 6 — Communication of Results",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: evaluated findings, audience knowledge of domain.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: narrative report, dashboard, or presentation that conveys key findings and",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "recommended actions to decision-makers.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Effective communication requires translating technical outputs into business terms. The team",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "quantifies business value (revenue impact, cost savings, risk reduction), documents key",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "assumptions, acknowledges limitations, and prepares supporting materials (code, data",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "dictionaries, reproducibility documentation).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall - model explainability missteps: presenting SHAP plots or feature importances",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "without business context confuses rather than informs stakeholders. Explanation tools are most",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "useful when tied to a specific decision the audience must make [Source 6].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-6-communication-of-results",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Phase 7 — Operationalization / Deployment",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Input: approved findings or model, deployment environment specifications.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Output: running system (scheduled report, API endpoint, embedded model), monitoring plan.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The team deploys the model or analysis process so that stakeholders can regularly access results.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pilot deployments in a controlled environment precede full rollout. Monitoring tracks whether",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "model performance degrades as data distributions shift over time.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Pitfall - ignoring concept drift: a model trained on historical data may fail silently as",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "real-world behavior changes. Without a monitoring plan and retraining schedule, model staleness",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "goes undetected [Source 6].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#phase-7-operationalization-deployment",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. The iterative nature of the lifecycle",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "All frameworks represent the lifecycle as cyclic or iterative, not strictly linear. Common",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Evaluation → Data Preparation: model fails to meet threshold; team engineers additional",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "features or acquires more data.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Modeling → Business Understanding: the most predictive variables are ones the business",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "cannot act on; problem definition must be revised.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Communication → Problem Definition: stakeholders raise a follow-up question not covered",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "by the original scope; a new project iteration begins.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Operationalization → Data Understanding: production data differs from training data in",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "distribution; team must re-examine source systems.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Treating the lifecycle as strictly sequential is a recognized anti-pattern. Teams that refuse to",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "revisit earlier phases when evidence demands it produce analyses that are technically complete but",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "practically useless [Source 1, Source 5].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#4-the-iterative-nature-of-the-lifecycle",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. Cross-cutting concerns",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "These concerns apply across all phases rather than belonging to a single one:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#5-cross-cutting-concerns",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Documentation and provenance",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Every transformation applied to data should be recorded so that findings can be reproduced and",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#documentation-and-provenance",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "audited. Missing metadata about data origins is one of the top causes of unreproducible analyses",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#documentation-and-provenance",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Stakeholder alignment",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Checkpoints between phases - presenting phase outputs to stakeholders before proceeding - catch",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#stakeholder-alignment",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "misalignment early. The cost of rework grows with each phase completed before a mismatch is",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#stakeholder-alignment",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Team roles",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "In TDSP, roles are explicitly assigned: project lead, data scientist, data engineer, solution",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#team-roles",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "architect, and business analyst each own specific deliverables. In smaller teams one person",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#team-roles",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "covers multiple roles, but the responsibilities remain distinct [Source 5].",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#team-roles",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Governance and ethics",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Data collection and use must comply with applicable regulations (GDPR, HIPAA, etc.) and internal",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#governance-and-ethics",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "data governance policies. These checks are easiest to apply at phase transitions, not after",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#governance-and-ethics",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Practical worked example",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Scenario: a retail company wants to reduce stockouts.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#6-practical-worked-example",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "At evaluation, the team discovers that weather features add noise rather than signal; they loop",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#6-practical-worked-example",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "back to Phase 3, drop those columns, and re-evaluate - a normal iteration, not a failure.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/da-2-data-analysis-lifecycle/#6-practical-worked-example",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
